inzhi:p002","text":"歆之被遇於太祖，歷顯官左民尚書，光祿大夫，卒官。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":67,"last_line":67,"raw_start":5756,"raw_end":5780,"raw_character_offsets":[5756,5757,5758,5759,5760,5761,5762,5763,5764,5765,5766,5767,5768,5769,5770,5771,5772,5773,5774,5775,5776,5777,5778,5779],"revision_id":2195614},"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangxinzhi:p002:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"歆之","kind":"person","person_id":"bd2_8y8_397","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangxinzhi:p002:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"太祖","kind":"person","person_id":"3bh_k4m_fg4","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-wangxinzhi","book_id":"b-songshu-092","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-092-wangxinzhi-ws2195614"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p001","text":"元嘉初，太祖遣大使巡行四方，兼散騎常侍孔默之、王歆之等上言：「宣威將軍、陳南頓二郡太守李元德，清勤均平，姦盜止息。彭城內史魏恭子，廉恪修慎，在公忘私，安約守儉，久而彌固。前宋縣令成浦，治政寬濟，遺詠在民。前鮦陽令李熙國，在事有方，民思其政。山桑令何道，自少清廉，白首彌厲。應加褒賚，以勸于後。」乃進元德號寧朔將軍，恭子賜絹五十匹，穀五百斛，浦、熙國、道各賜絹三十匹，穀二百斛。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":62,"last_line":62,"raw_start":5509,"raw_end":5697,"raw_character_offsets":[5509,5510,5511,5512,5513,5514,5515,5516,5517,5518,5519,5520,5521,5522,5523,5524,5525,5526,5527,5528,5529,5530,5531,5532,5533,5534,5535,5536,5537,5538,5539,5540,5541,5542,5543,5544,5545,5546,5547,5548,5549,5550,5551,5552,5553,5554,5555,5556,5557,5558,5559,5560,5561,5562,5563,5564,5565,5566,5567,5568,5569,5570,5571,5572,5573,5574,5575,5576,5577,5578,5579,5580,5581,5582,5583,5584,5585,5586,5587,5588,5589,5590,5591,5592,5593,5594,5595,5596,5597,5598,5599,5600,5601,5602,5603,5604,5605,5606,5607,5608,5609,5610,5611,5612,5613,5614,5615,5616,5617,5618,5619,5620,5621,5622,5623,5624,5625,5626,5627,5628,5629,5630,5631,5632,5633,5634,5635,5636,5637,5638,5639,5640,5641,5642,5643,5644,5645,5646,5647,5648,5649,5650,5651,5652,5653,5654,5655,5656,5657,5658,5659,5660,5661,5662,56